# C++

- C++20, Allman braces, 4-space indent, LF, UTF-8 BOM on `*.{cpp,h}` (`.clang-format`, `.editorconfig`).
- Format with the repo clang-format (clang-format-20). Do not hand-reflow.
- Bind new Lua APIs next to existing helpers in `src/map/lua/`.
- Prefer existing types in `src/common/` over new utilities.
- Do not change `ext/` third-party code unless asked.
